# Home sections

## Landing (hero)

Single full-viewport band — `HomeLanding.vue` (`#landing`):

- **Full-bleed slideshow** — `hero_image_urls` (crossfade, ~5.5s when 2+ photos); text overlay unchanged. Falls back to placeholder art when empty.
- **Text overlay** — centered `madd.lines` (Oswald) + signature from `hero_title` (Great Vibes); white type (`--color-paper`) with a soft ink scrim for contrast

Height: full viewport (`100dvh`). The header floats over the image; home `app-main` has **no top padding**.

## Stack (do not reorder unless asked)

**Landing** (`HomeLanding`) → **My art** (`HomeMyArtSection`) → footer

There is **no about section**, **no separate artwork marquee**, and **no separate testimonial marquee** on the home page. Do not restore `HomeAboutSection`, `HomeAboutMeSection`, or the admin about preview. Leftover `about_*` Mongo fields may still save so old files are not wiped.

## My art section

`HomeMyArtSection.vue` — single `<section id="my-art">` with:

- Centered **my art** masthead (`HomePlaceholderSection` masthead styles only)
- `HomeMyArtMarquee` embedded below (not its own `<section>`)

Layout (`home-page-layout.css`):

- `min-height: 100dvh`, `display: flex`, `justify-content: center` — content sits **vertically centered** in a full-viewport pink band
- No standalone `home-pink-spacer` before my art; the section **is** the viewport band

## Paired art + review marquee

Home uses **one** combined carousel — not alternating image/quote tiles.

| Piece | Role |
|---|---|
| `HomeMyArtMarquee.vue` | Data + `HomeMarqueeSection` (`embedded`, `show-fade="false"`, `section-class="home-my-art-marquee"`) |
| `pairMarqueeItems.js` | Builds `{ variant: 'paired', src, alt, quote, name, role }` cards |
| `MarqueeTile.vue` | `paired` variant: image top (~52%), review bottom (white paper, divider) |
| `resolveArtworkMarqueeItems` | Gallery works → image list; falls back to `PLACEHOLDER_ARTWORK` |
| `PLACEHOLDER_TESTIMONIALS` | Review copy until CMS-linked pairs exist |

**Data model (future):** pairs will arrive as linked records from the API. Until then, `pairMarqueeItems` zips artwork + reviews by index (cycles the shorter list). When real linked data lands, resolve pairs in one place and keep `variant: 'paired'` on the tile.

Paired tile height: `--marquee-tile-height: 440px` desktop / `380px` mobile (scoped to `.home-my-art-marquee`). Standalone `HomeArtworkMarquee` / `HomeTestimonialMarquee` still exist for reuse but are **not** mounted on `Home.vue`.

## Shared marquee mechanics

- `HomeMarqueeSection.vue` — 40s loop, 32px gap, pause on hover; `embedded` keeps `aria-label` on the wrapper `div`
- `MarqueeTile.vue` variants: `quote` | `image` | `paired`
- One CSS file: `marquee-section.css` — do not fork tile sizes per variant

Home my-art marquee: **no edge fades** (`show-fade="false"`).

## Header destinations

Three items in `useStorefrontSectionNav` / `storefrontSections.js`:

| Label | Scrolls to | Also covers |
|---|---|---|
| **artist** | top of the page (`#landing`) | landing text + hero photo |
| **portfolio** | `#my-art` | my art marquee |
| **contact** | footer `#say-hi` | contact + book |

Old hashes (`#about`, `#gallery`, `#contact`) still resolve. `#say-hi` must land below the floated header (`--nav-float-top`). Header breakpoint is **768px** — not 640px (`site-header.mdc`).

## Footer (home context)

`SiteFooter.vue` on white paper: brand + social only in utility row; contact form + decorative `BookCta` calendar in two columns. Pink accents on footer use `--color-surface-pink` (`var(--color-bg)`), not ink. Hero **madd.lines** stays ink-on-pink for contrast.
